match O then [ PitchDown PitchDown PitchDown D ColorNext RollRight W RollRight RollRight RollRight RollRight W RollRight RollRight RollRight RollRight W RollRight RollRight RollRight RollRight W RollRight RollRight RollRight RollRight W ];
match D then F F;
match W then [ ColorNext PitchUp F ] [ WidthDecrease PitchDown PitchDown PitchDown PitchDown Minus f Plus f TurnAround Minus f Plus f WidthIncrease ];
